{
 "rule": "nearest wins: only the nearest present slider within trigger_m (desk plane) slides; a cursor ON a slider (its home footprint or its silhouette on screen; the front-most silhouette under the cursor wins first) takes it at once; otherwise the one out keeps it unless another is nearer by more than hysteresis_m; on a hand-off the loser retracts in retract.seconds (ease-in-out, no linger, no seat) and the winner starts once the loser is under retract.winner_below of its travel (nearly seated) or after retract.winner_after s (the retract's length), so one machine moves at a time",
 "trigger_m": 0.07,
 "hysteresis_m": 0.02,
 "retract": {
  "seconds": 0.13,
  "ease": "easeInOutQuad",
  "winner_after": 0.13,
  "winner_below": 0.1
 },
 "felt_gap_m": 0.004,
 "felt_gap_px": 3,
 "lamp_gap_px": 3,
 "lift_squash": {
  "px": 1.5,
  "release_s": 0.06
 },
